MoveIt quick notes

```bash
cd ~/ros2_ws
source install/setup.bash
ros2 launch smallrobot_moveit moveit.launch.py
```

URDF check:
```bash
cd ~/ros2_ws/src/sr6_ros2/smallrobot_description/urdf
ros2 run xacro xacro smallrobot.urdf.xacro > smallrobot.urdf
check_urdf smallrobot.urdf
```

Setup Assistant:
```bash
cd ~/ros2_ws
source install/setup.bash
ros2 launch moveit_setup_assistant setup_assistant.launch.py
```

Notes:
- This package is configured to launch `move_group` with the `ompl` pipeline by default.
- If you use a separate MoveIt source workspace, source that overlay before `~/ros2_ws/install/setup.bash`.
